data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md\", \"content\": \"# Dispatch d002 summary\\n\\nImplemented exactly the scope requested:\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` — `greet(name)` returns `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` — unittest `TestCase` with two tests:\\n   - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"World\\\") == \\\"Hello, World!\\\"`\\n   - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n\\nRan from repo root:\\n\\n    python3 -m unittest discover -s tests\\n\\nResult: `OK`, 2 tests run, **exit code 0**. All tests passed.\\n\\nCommitted both new files to branch\\n`cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>` at commit `162d728`\\n(\\\"Add greet function and tests (dispatch d002)\\\"), on top of base `2ee2657`.\\nNo other files were added or modified (only `__pycache__/` dirs were\\ngenerated by the test run and left untracked, not committed).\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

